{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The key understanding here is that you can factor a monomial in many different ways!\n\nTo check if any of the factorizations is correct, we can multiply the factors and see if their product is really $45y^6$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{9}\\maroonD{y^3})(\\blueD{5}\\maroonD{y^3})\u0026=(\\blueD{9})(\\blueD{5})(\\maroonD{y^3})(\\maroonD{y^3})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{45}\\maroonD{y^6}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Fernando is correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(\\blueD{3}\\maroonD{y})(\\blueD{15}\\maroonD{y^5})\u0026=(\\blueD{3})(\\blueD{15})(\\maroonD{y})(\\maroonD{y^5})\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\blueD{45}\\maroonD{y^6}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo Salma is correct!","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Both Fernando and Salma are correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Fernando factored $45y^6$ as $(9y^3)(5y^3)$.\n\nSalma factored $45y^6$ as $(3y)(15y^5)$.\n\n**Which of them factored $45y^6$ correctly?\n**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"Only Fernando","correct":false},{"content":"Only Salma","correct":false},{"content":"Both Fernando and Salma","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"Neither Fernando nor Salma","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
